{"3304490": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Japanese Calligraphy", "steam_appid": 3304490, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Live Streaming and Gameplay Welcome!!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>**[Calligraphy Simulator Game]**</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Write characters on Japanese calligraphy paper using a brush. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the art of calligraphy on your computer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully reproduce the brush techniques like *tome*, *hane*, and *harai*!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304490/extras/ce8abcc03c2815a31b543b3d47125eb7.poster.avif?t=1731578220\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304490/extras/ce8abcc03c2815a31b543b3d47125eb7.webm?t=1731578220\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304490/extras/ce8abcc03c2815a31b543b3d47125eb7.mp4?t=1731578220\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >**[Hiragana &amp; Katakana]**</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn how to write hiragana and katakana by tracing the 50-syllable charts.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >**[Calligraphy Practice]**</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Practice calligraphy following examples and get used to brush movements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are various examples, including single characters, two characters, four-character idioms, and large-format paper.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >**[Sutra Copying]**</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handwrite the *Heart Sutra* and engrave its sacred words into your heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It could also be used as a form of atonement, like waterfall meditation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >**[Kanji Test]**</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test yourself on the kanji learned in elementary school.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Self-score and check whether you got them right!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >**[Free Mode]**</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In different settings, feel free to write anything with a brush.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Live Streaming and Gameplay Welcome!!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>**[Calligraphy Simulator Game]**</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Write characters on Japanese calligraphy paper using a brush. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the art of calligraphy on your computer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully reproduce the brush techniques like *tome*, *hane*, and *harai*!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304490/extras/ce8abcc03c2815a31b543b3d47125eb7.poster.avif?t=1731578220\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304490/extras/ce8abcc03c2815a31b543b3d47125eb7.webm?t=1731578220\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304490/extras/ce8abcc03c2815a31b543b3d47125eb7.mp4?t=1731578220\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >**[Hiragana &amp; Katakana]**</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn how to write hiragana and katakana by tracing the 50-syllable charts.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >**[Calligraphy Practice]**</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Practice calligraphy following examples and get used to brush movements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are various examples, including single characters, two characters, four-character idioms, and large-format paper.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >**[Sutra Copying]**</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handwrite the *Heart Sutra* and engrave its sacred words into your heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It could also be used as a form of atonement, like waterfall meditation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >**[Kanji Test]**</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test yourself on the kanji learned in elementary school.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Self-score and check whether you got them right!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >**[Free Mode]**</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In different settings, feel free to write anything with a brush.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "A Japanese Calligraphy Simulator Game! Not only can you practice writing with a brush following examples, but you can also practice writing hiragana and katakana! Self-scoring kanji tests! Grateful sutra copying! Let's study Japanese!", "supported_languages": "English, Japanese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304490/header.jpg?t=1731578220", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304490/3a26c9ce53606f0f5febb4a85c70d2d4eb93cf6a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1731578220", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304490/3a26c9ce53606f0f5febb4a85c70d2d4eb93cf6a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1731578220", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7/8/8.1/10/11</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["NoraPerikaProject"], "publishers": ["NoraPerikaProject"], "price_overview": {"currency": "USD", "initial": 99, "final": 99, "discount_percent": 0, "initial_formatted": "", "final_formatted": "$0.99"}, "packages": [1170370], "package_groups": [{"name": "default", "title": "Buy The Japanese Calligraphy", "description": "", "selection_text": "Select a purchase option", "save_text": "", "display_type": 0, "is_recurring_subscription": "false", "subs": [{